 data-bl-k=\"dialog\" data-bl-label=\"Menu\"><div class=\"gh-dialog__panel\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"gh-dialog__header\" data-bl-b=\"\"><h2 id=\"_R_4d5esneknelb_\" class=\"gh-dialog__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Menu</span></h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--ghost gh-dialog__close\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Close</span></button></div><div class=\"gh-dialog__body\"><ul class=\"gh-menu\"><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Home</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/our-story\" aria-current=\"page\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Adventures</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/sign-in\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign in</span></a></li></ul></div></div></dialog></div><span hidden=\"\" data-nav-fit=\"whole\"></span></nav></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"gh-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Our Story\"><header class=\"gh-pagehead\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Our Story\"><div class=\"gh-pagehead__inner\"><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our Story</span></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h1 class=\"gh-h gh-h--1 gh-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our Story</span></h1><p class=\"gh-lede gh-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From a friend’s wedding to our own, these are the moments that brought us here.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"chapters\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"How we met\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><ol class=\"gh-spine\" aria-label=\"Chapters\"><li id=\"how-we-met\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span id=\"allison-and-jamies-wedding\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">01</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">1</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Meeting</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How we met</span></h2><div class=\"gh-prose gh-prose--lead\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We met at Allison and Jamie’s wedding, at a celebration for friends we cared about. Neither of us was looking for a relationship, but we hit it off almost immediately—flirty glances across the room, then an evening of talking, playing games, and getting to know each other. Before the night was over, Tyler asked Sara out, and a new chapter began.</span></p></div><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22911%22%20height%3D%22683%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"A wedding reception table set with roses, glassware and white chair covers.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara and Tyler’s wedding website copy</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"the-connection\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span id=\"museum-of-ice-cream\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"richardson-farm\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"michael-jordans-steakhouse\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"food-tastings\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"gardening-together\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">02</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Connection</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The connection</span></h2><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our first date was mini golf, a walk along the river, and sharing plates at The Cheesecake Factory. We were curious about each other, and with every conversation we found another reason to want to know more. By our fourth date, something had shifted. We ended the evening at Michael Jordan’s Steak House, laughing and smiling throughout dinner. When Tyler dropped Sara off at the train, we both knew this was something special. Along the way we kept finding places that felt like ours—the Museum of Ice Cream, Richardson Farm, food tastings, and time gardening together.</span></p></div><section class=\"story-carousel gh-spine__carousel\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"The connection\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"The connection\"><div class=\"story-carousel__viewport\"><ol class=\"story-carousel__track\" aria-live=\"off\" style=\"transform:translateX(-0%)\"><li id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-slide-1\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-1\"><span id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-1\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">1</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22911%22%20height%3D%22683%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"A scoop of raspberry sorbet in a cone, held up against a pale wall.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure></li><li id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-slide-2\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-2\"><span id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-2\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221024%22%20height%3D%22768%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"White barns beyond a field of ripe grain under a grey sky.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure></li><li id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-slide-3\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-3\"><span id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-3\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">3</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221%22%20height%3D%221%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"A plated steak with greens beside wine glasses on a dark restaurant table.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure></li><li id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-slide-4\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-4\"><span id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-4\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">4</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221%22%20height%3D%221%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"Wine bottles and empty tasting glasses lined up on a wooden bar with tasting sheets.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure></li><li id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-slide-5\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-5\"><span id=\"_R_22qf5esneknelb_-label-5\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221%22%20height%3D%221%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"A garden harvest in a green tub: red potatoes, beets, courgettes and beans.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure></li></ol></div><div class=\"story-carousel__controls\"><ul class=\"story-carousel__dots\" aria-label=\"The connection slides\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 1 of 5\" aria-current=\"true\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 2 of 5\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 3 of 5\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 4 of 5\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 5 of 5\"></button></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__pause\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Pause slideshow</span></button></div></section><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara and Tyler’s wedding website copy</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"our-life-together\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">03</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">3</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Together</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our life together</span></h2><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Since then, we’ve built a life around curiosity, shared values, and a sense of adventure. We both love discovering new places, trying new restaurants, and sharing the things that excite us. Tyler is always ready to embrace an adventure and see where it takes us, while Sara brings a thoughtful perspective and notices the little things along the way. We balance each other in the best ways, encouraging one another to try new things, see different perspectives, and keep growing together. Whether we’re exploring somewhere new, tending to the garden, or enjoying our favorite traditions, we’re happiest experiencing life together.</span></p></div><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara and Tyler’s wedding website copy</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"love\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span id=\"madison-waterfront\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"starved-rock\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">04</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">4</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Love</span></h2><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We said “I love you” for the first time at Starved Rock State Park. The Madison waterfront belongs in this chapter of our story too.</span></p></div><section class=\"story-carousel gh-spine__carousel\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"Love\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Love\"><div class=\"story-carousel__viewport\"><ol class=\"story-carousel__track\" aria-live=\"off\" style=\"transform:translateX(-0%)\"><li id=\"_R_24qf5esneknelb_-slide-1\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_24qf5esneknelb_-label-1\"><span id=\"_R_24qf5esneknelb_-label-1\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">1</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span></span><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22911%22%20height%3D%22683%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"Bright red kayaks on a wooden dock at the edge of Lake Monona in Madison, Wisconsin.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure></li><li id=\"_R_24qf5esneknelb_-slide-2\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_24qf5esneknelb_-label-2\"><span id=\"_R_24qf5esneknelb_-label-2\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span></span><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221024%22%20height%3D%22768%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"French Canyon at Starved Rock State Park: sandstone walls and green trees around a narrow canyon.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure></li></ol></div><div class=\"story-carousel__controls\"><ul class=\"story-carousel__dots\" aria-label=\"Love slides\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 1 of 2\" aria-current=\"true\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 2 of 2\"></button></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__pause\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Pause slideshow</span></button></div></section><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara and Tyler’s wedding website copy</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"greater-together\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">05</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ahead</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Greater together than alone</span></h2><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Now, we’re excited to keep growing together, build a family, and share many more adventures. To us, marriage is about more than the two of us. The people in our lives have helped shape who we are, and those experiences and relationships helped make us the people who found each other. We wouldn’t be who we are, or the couple we are today, without our family and friends.</span></p></div><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22921%22%20height%3D%22691%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"The Chicago skyline across Lake Michigan at sunrise, the sky pink and gold.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara and Tyler’s wedding website copy</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"the-proposal\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">06</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">6</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Engagement</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The proposal</span></h2><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our engagement was a love letter to the story we’d been building. Over the course of a summer, Tyler took Sara back to places that held special memories for us. When the day finally came, he surprised her with an indoor picnic surrounded by photos and mementos from our time together, celebrating the journey that brought us here and all the adventures still to come.</span></p></div><figure data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22853%22%20height%3D%22640%22%2F%3E\" alt=\"A close-up of a pale pink diamond ring resting on sparkling beads.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"><figcaption><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photograph until ours arrives.</span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara and Tyler’s wedding website copy</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"what-marriage-means\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">07</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">7</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Marriage</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What marriage means to us</span></h2><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">That’s why having you celebrate with us means so much. We’re bringing together the people who have been part of our stories, and we can’t think of a better way to begin this next chapter than surrounded by all of you.</span></p></div><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara and Tyler’s wedding website copy</span></span></span></p></div></li></ol></div></section><section id=\"next\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--alt\" aria-labelledby=\"next-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Keep going\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"next-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Keep going</span></h2></div><p class=\"gh-section__action\"><a class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--secondary\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Wander through our adventures</span></span></a></p></div></section></main><nav class=\"gh-panel\" aria-label=\"Quick actions\" style=\"--cells:2\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Quick actions\"><a class=\"gh-panel__cell\" href=\"/our-story\" aria-current=\"page\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 5h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4zM20 5h-7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Story</span></span></a><a class=\"gh-panel__cell\" href=\"/our-adventures\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"